  "Off": "关闭",
  "Off, your own background is left out of it: the theme keeps its own colours while the picture is up, and only moves when a title's artwork covers it.": "关闭时，你自己的背景不参与其中：图片显示期间主题保持自身配色，只有当某部作品的海报图覆盖上来时才会变化。",
  "On the air": "正在播出",
  "On, the background follows whichever card you're pointing at or have selected. Off, it only changes when you actually open something — steadier on a long list, where sweeping across a row otherwise repaints the whole window card by card.": "开启时，背景会跟随你指向或选中的卡片。关闭时，只有你真正打开某个条目时才会变化——在长列表中更稳定，否则在一行中滑动就会让整个窗口逐张卡片重绘。",
  "On, your picture is what the app rests on and the artwork covers it while you're on a film or show. Off, the picture stays put and nothing ever covers it.": "开启时，应用铺在你的图片之上，而当你进入某部影片或剧集时海报图会覆盖它。关闭时，图片保持不动，永远不会被覆盖。",
  "One colour, and Material's own generator works out the rest of the palette from it.": "一种颜色，Material 自带的生成器会据此推算出配色的其余部分。",
  "One earlier episode in this season is still unwatched.": "本季还有一集之前的剧集尚未观看。",
