  "The download couldn't be started.": "无法开始下载。",
  "The download didn't finish.": "下载未完成。",
  "The exception is Dolby or DTS handed straight to a receiver over HDMI, which Android does where it can — nothing in the app touches that sound, so neither setting has any effect on it. An amplifier doing that has a night mode of its own.": "例外是通过 HDMI 原样送往功放的 Dolby 或 DTS，Android 在可行时会这么做——应用不碰这份声音，因此两项设置对它都没有作用。这样工作的功放自带夜间模式。",
  "The film is played as it was mixed.": "按混音时的样子播放影片。",
  "The link this source gave answered HTTP {status}. It may have expired — search the sources again for a fresh one.": "此来源提供的链接返回 HTTP {status}。可能已过期 — 请重新搜索来源以获取新链接。",
  "The link this source gave could not be reached.": "无法访问该来源给出的链接。",
  "The other device refused the film.": "对方设备拒绝了该影片。",
  "The other device streams this film from here, so nothing is downloaded twice. Both have to be on the same network, and it has to be switched on for casting under Settings → Network.": "对方设备从这里获取这部影片，因此不会重复下载。两台设备必须在同一网络中，并且对方需要在“设置 → 网络”中打开投放。",
  "The picture currently behind the app": "当前位于应用背后的图片",
  "The player area never got a size, so playback was not started.": "播放器区域始终没有获得尺寸，因此没有开始播放。",
  "The player itself — decoding, subtitles and audio. GPLv2 or later.": "播放器本身——解码、字幕和音频。GPLv2 或更高版本。",
  "The project does not host, run, endorse or recommend any source, and does not distribute a list of them.": "本项目不托管、不运营、不认可、不推荐任何来源，也不分发它们的名单。",
  "The project on GitHub": "GitHub 上的项目",
  "The release carries no update for this platform.": "该发行版没有适用于此平台的更新。",
  "The source fetched this already — it plays at once and keeps nothing on this device": "来源已经取好了这份内容——立即播放，且不会在本设备上留下任何东西",
  "The supporter list couldn't be loaded — the Ko-fi page above has the current one.": "支持者名单加载失败——上面的 Ko-fi 页面上有最新的。",
  "The torrent engine accepted the magnet but gave it no id.": "种子引擎接受了磁力链接，但没有给它分配编号。",
  "The torrent engine, embedded in the app. MIT licensed.": "内嵌在应用中的种子引擎。采用 MIT 许可证。",
  "The torrent stream isn't ready yet (engine replied HTTP {status}). It may still be fetching metadata from peers.": "种子流尚未就绪（引擎返回 HTTP {status}）。它可能仍在从对等端获取元数据。",
  "The update couldn't be installed: {error}": "无法安装更新：{error}",
  "Theme": "主题",
  "There is barely room for one film here. Plug a USB drive into the box — formatted FAT32, which every Android box accepts — and it appears above to download onto instead.": "这里勉强只放得下一部电影。请在盒子上插入一个 U 盘——格式化为 FAT32，所有 Android 盒子都能识别——它会出现在上方，供你改为下载到那里。",
  "There is no account to sign in to and nothing syncs to a server. What you watch, how far you got, your favourites and your watchlist are all stored on this device and never leave it. Syncing between screens is planned; until then, the backup below is how a library moves.": "没有账户可登录，也没有任何内容同步到服务器。你看了什么、看到哪里、你的收藏和待看列表，全都存放在本设备上，从不外传。跨屏幕同步已在计划之中；在此之前，下面的备份文件就是媒体库搬家的方式。",
  "There's no {file} in your documents folder. Copy one there and try again.": "你的文档文件夹里没有 {file}。请复制一份过去后重试。",
  "This connection is metered right now.": "当前连接按流量计费。",
  "This connection is not metered right now.": "当前连接不按流量计费。",
  "This copy wasn't installed by Ventic's own installer — a package manager, or a build from source — so whatever put it there is what updates it. Replacing the files from in here would only confuse it.": "这份副本不是由 Ventic 自带的安装程序安装的——而是来自包管理器，或从源码构建——因此把它放在那里的东西才负责更新它。从这里替换文件只会让它混乱。",
  "This device couldn't start serving the film to the network.": "这台设备未能开始把影片提供到网络。",
  "This device is called": "这台设备名为",
  "This device is streaming a film to another one right now.": "这台设备正在向另一台设备传输影片。",
  "This device is streaming a film to {device} right now.": "这台设备正在向 {device} 传输影片。",
  "This device is streaming the film to it. Leave Ventic running until you're done — closing it stops the stream.": "这台设备正在向它传输影片。看完之前请让 Ventic 保持运行 — 关闭会中断传输。",
  "This device isn't on a network Ventic can see. Type the other device's address instead.": "这台设备不在 Ventic 能看到的网络中。请改为输入对方设备的地址。",
  "This device's decoder gave up on the file. That is usually the audio: Dolby (AC-3, E-AC-3, TrueHD) and DTS are not licensed into the system webview, so a release carrying one plays as a picture with no sound, or not at all. An x264 release with AAC audio will play.": "本设备的解码器放弃了该文件。原因通常出在音频：Dolby（AC-3、E-AC-3、TrueHD）和 DTS 未在系统 webview 中获得授权，因此带有这类音频的资源只会有画面没有声音，或者根本无法播放。使用 AAC 音频的 x264 资源可以正常播放。",
  "This file has one audio track.": "该文件只有一条音轨。",
