  "Ventic": "Ventic",
  "Ventic TV": "Ventic TV",
  "Ventic asks a source for {movie}, or {series}, and expects a {streams} array back. Add several and their results are merged, with duplicates dropped and earlier sources preferred.": "Ventic 会向来源请求 {movie} 或 {series}，并期待返回一个 {streams} 数组。添加多个来源时，结果会合并，去掉重复项，并优先采用先添加的来源。",
  "Ventic downloads the new package and Android asks you to confirm the install. It is signed with the same key as the copy you have, so it upgrades in place and keeps your library.": "Ventic 会下载新的安装包，然后由 Android 请你确认安装。它与你现有的副本使用同一个密钥签名，因此会原地升级并保留你的媒体库。",
  "Ventic has no sources configured, so there is nowhere to search. You can still play a magnet or a torrent file you open yourself.": "Ventic 尚未配置任何来源，因此无处可搜。你仍然可以播放自己打开的磁力链接或种子文件。",
  "Ventic hosts no content, indexes no content, and ships with no sources configured. It is a BitTorrent client with a player attached: it fetches only what you point it at, from servers you added yourself.": "Ventic 不托管内容、不索引内容，出厂时也不配置任何来源。它是一个附带播放器的 BitTorrent 客户端：只从你自己添加的服务器抓取你指定的内容。",
  "Ventic is MIT licensed. The components it is built on keep their own terms, listed above; on Windows the bundled mpv is GPL software and its licence and offer of source sit next to the application's executable.": "Ventic 采用 MIT 许可证。它所依赖的组件各自保留上面列出的条款；在 Windows 上，随附的 mpv 是 GPL 软件，其许可证和源码提供声明就放在应用可执行文件旁边。",
  "Ventic is free, has no ads, no account and nothing to sell. It costs money to sign, host and keep running — a donation is what covers that, and nothing in the app changes whether you give one or not.": "Ventic 免费，没有广告、不需要账户，也没有任何东西可卖。签名、托管和维持运行都要花钱——捐助补的就是这部分，而无论你是否捐助，应用里的一切都不会变。",
  "Ventic is up to date.": "Ventic 已是最新版本。",
  "Ventic keeps your library on this device. Carrying it to another screen is the backup file below.": "Ventic 把你的媒体库保存在本设备上。要带到另一块屏幕上，靠的就是下面的备份文件。",
  "Ventic searches nothing by itself. A source is a URL you add here, pointing at a server that answers with things to play. What a source offers, and whether you have the right to play it, is between you and whoever runs it.": "Ventic 自身不会搜索任何东西。来源是你在这里添加的一个网址，指向一台会返回可播放内容的服务器。某个来源提供什么，以及你是否有权播放，是你与运营它的人之间的事。",
  "Ventic speaks the {protocol}. Any Stremio addon URL works here — paste the {link} link or the {manifest} address and it'll be trimmed to what's needed.": "Ventic 使用 {protocol}。任何 Stremio 插件网址在这里都可用——粘贴 {link} 链接或 {manifest} 地址，它会被裁剪成需要的部分。",
  "Ventic will send it the title you're looking for and play what it hands back. Only add servers you trust — this one is not run by, or checked by, this app.": "Ventic 会把你要找的作品名发给它，并播放它返回的内容。只添加你信任的服务器——它并非由本应用运营或审核。",
  "Ventic {version} is out": "Ventic {version} 已发布",
