  "What a source has to speak": "来源需要会说的协议",
  "What language the app is in, and what language film and show descriptions are fetched in.": "应用使用的语言，以及获取影视简介所用的语言。",
  "What sits behind the app": "应用背后显示什么",
  "What this works on": "作用范围",
  "Whatever the disk allows": "磁盘允许多少就用多少",
  "Where downloads go": "下载存放的位置",
  "Where films and episodes are written. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "电影和剧集写入的位置。已经下载好的种子会留在原处。",
  "Where to keep downloads": "下载保存在哪里",
  "Which copy to reach for when Ventic picks one for you. It is a preference and not a filter: a tier with nothing worth streaming in it falls through to the next, so asking for 4K on a title that has none still plays the best 1080p.": "当 Ventic 替你挑选时，优先找哪一档的副本。这是偏好而不是筛选：某一档里没有值得串流的内容时会落到下一档，所以对没有 4K 的片子选 4K，播放的仍是最好的 1080p。",
  "Which drive films and episodes are written to — a plugged-in stick usually holds far more than the box itself. Uninstalling the app still removes them. Torrents already downloaded stay where they are.": "电影和剧集写入哪个驱动器——插上的 U 盘通常比盒子本身能装得多得多。卸载应用时它们仍会被删除。已经下载好的种子会留在原处。",
  "Worth turning on wherever the app feels heavy — a television or a set-top box most of all, where the graphics chip is a fraction of a laptop's.": "凡是觉得应用卡顿的地方都值得开启——尤其是电视或机顶盒，它们的图形芯片只有笔记本电脑的一小部分性能。",
